# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Portfolio environment configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in what you need locally.
# `.env` files are git-ignored — never commit real values.
#
# Vite exposes only `VITE_`-prefixed variables to client code, which means
# anything listed here ends up in the public JavaScript bundle. Never put
# private API keys, tokens, or other secrets in a `VITE_` variable.
# Secrets belong on a server (or serverless function), not in this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional — public HTTP endpoint that accepts a JSON POST of
#   { name, email, message, source }
# and answers with a 2xx status on success.
#
# Works with any provider that exposes such an endpoint (Formspree, Web3Forms,
# Basin, ...) or with your own serverless function.
#
# When this variable is empty:
#   - the contact form is hidden,
#   - direct email and social links remain available,
#   - no message can be submitted or reported as delivered.
#
# Example:
#   VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public production origin of the site (no trailing slash, no path).
#
# Used for: canonical URLs, Open Graph `og:url` / `og:image`, JSON-LD node ids,
# `public/sitemap.xml`, and the `Sitemap:` line in the built robots.txt.
#
# When unset, the runtime falls back to the origin the site is served from
# (correct after deployment, and simply localhost while developing), and the
# build scripts skip the artefacts that require absolute URLs — they print a
# warning naming exactly what they skipped. The domain is never guessed.
#
# On Vercel/Netlify the provider's own build URL variable is used automatically
# when this is empty; set it explicitly when using a custom domain.
#
# Example:
#   VITE_SITE_URL=https://abdelrahmanaziz.com
VITE_SITE_URL=
